  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s prior-life memory of Ma Hong Yun, Sheng Ling Er, Sheng tribe leader’s third daughter, supplies him with Gu worms and primeval stones, and steals her tribe’s precious Gu to raise his aptitude to A grade. When that theft is exposed, Sheng tribe leader does not want his daughter to marry this poor lad, so he secretly sends an expert to kill Ma Hong Yun. The expert argues with someone on the way and is killed. The pair still marry and hold an important position in the tribe. Jealous Sheng tribesmen plot against him, and he has no choice but to escape toward poison grassland.",
